WEBVTT

43:03.530 --> 43:05.573
Hey, you guys,
I think I found him!

43:05.658 --> 43:08.368
Buzz, is that you?

43:08.452 --> 43:10.453
Whiskers, will you
get outta here!

43:10.537 --> 43:13.414
You're interfering
with the search and rescue!

43:14.875 --> 43:16.709
Look, they're home.

43:21.882 --> 43:23.466
Mom, have you seen Woody?

43:23.550 --> 43:25.134
Where was the last place
you left him?

43:25.219 --> 43:26.469
Right here in the van.

43:26.553 --> 43:29.222
Oh, I'm sure he's there.
You're just not looking hard enough.

43:29.306 --> 43:31.808
He's not here, Mom.
Woody's gone.
